;CHAINS LABELED A (CCP NUMBER 1) AND B (CYTOCHROME C
NUMBER 1) REPRESENT ONE COMPLEX MOLECULE IN THE ASYMMETRIC
UNIT, AND, LIKEWISE, CHAINS LABELED C (CCP NUMBER 2) AND
D (CYTOCHROME C NUMBER 2) REPRESENT THE SECOND COMPLEX
MOLECULE IN THE ASYMMETRIC UNIT.  WATER MOLECULES NUMBERED
301 TO 554 ARE ASSOCIATED WITH THE FIRST COMPLEX, AND WATER
MOLECULES NUMBERED 600 TO 848 ARE ASSOCIATED WITH THE
SECOND COMPLEX.
