;IN ACCORDANCE WITH THE SEQUENCE NUMBERING FOR EUKARYOTIC
CYTOCHROMES C, THE SEQUENCE NUMBERING FOR THE YEAST
CYTOCHROMES C IN THIS STRUCTURE BEGINS WITH -5.  THERE IS
NO RESIDUE WITH A SEQUENCE NUMBER 0.  COORDINATES FOR THE
METHYL GROUPS OF THE TRIMETHYLATED LYSINE (RESIDUE 72) ARE
INCLUDED IN THE 1YCC ENTRY, BUT THEY ARE NOT INCLUDED HERE
DUE TO SIDE CHAIN DISORDER.  RESIDUE NUMBER 72 OF THE TWO
YEAST ISO-1-CYTOCHROMES C IN THIS STRUCTURE ARE LEFT AS
LYSINES.
;
